Aqua (Water)Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel) Leaf Water [1]Caprylic/Capric Triglycerideisopropyl isostearateGlycerinC 12-16 AlcoholsOlive Oil Decyl EstersButyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter [1]Hydrogenated LecithinPalmitic AcidArgania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil [1]TalcCedrus Atlantica (Cedar) Bark Oil [1]Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed OilCymbopogon Martini (Palmarosa) Oil [1]Juniperus Communis Fruit ExtractLavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Oil [1]Sucrose PalmitateCetearyl AlcoholSqualeneGlyceryl Stearate SECitric AcidTocopherol (Vitamin E)Sodium BenzoateDehydroacetic AcidPotassium SorbateSodium HydroxideGlyceryl Stearate CitrateMannanSucroseXanthan GumBiosaccharide Gum-1Glyceryl CaprylateSodium AnisateSodium LevulinateBenzyl AlcoholLinaloolGeraniolLimonene',19500,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/florame-hom-baum-a-rasage-75ml.png?v=1741437790',10,1,'8180402618543','44969182560431','https://beautymarket.ma/products/florame-homme-baume-apres-rasage-75ml',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/florame-hom-baum-a-rasage-75ml.png?v=1741437790"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
