Revolution Superdewy Liquid Blush You Had Me At First Blush – rose vibrant

Revolution Superdewy Liquid Blush Flushing For You – rose vif

Revolution Superdewy Liquid Blush Fake The Flush – ton pêche

Revolution Superdewy Liquid Blush Blush Me Up – ton chocolat chaud

Revolution Superdewy Liquid Blush You Got Me Blushing – rose pâle

Conseils d''utilisation :

Appliquer la taille d''un pois sur le haut de vos joues et estomper sur la peau avec les doigts ou un pinceau. Ce produit s''utilise aussi sur les yeux, le nez et les tempes.',7900,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/superdewyBlushmeup1_38240dff-e8df-4a1f-8d57-84bb4372047a.jpg?v=1753902902',10,1,'8279632019631','45741356023983','https://beautymarket.ma/products/revolution-superdewy-liquid-blusher-blush-me-up',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/superdewyBlushmeup1_38240dff-e8df-4a1f-8d57-84bb4372047a.jpg?v=1753902902","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/superdewyBlushmeup3.webp?v=1774948689","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/superdewyBlushmeup2.webp?v=1774948688"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
