• Material Girl Wine – Rose profond et riche.
• Rebel Rust – Orange doux.
• Divine Brown – Nude froid.',7900,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/1659406-Revolution-Lastiiss-Lipstick-Divine-Brown-1.jpg?v=1755882023',10,1,'8293202067631','45806645543087','https://beautymarket.ma/products/revolution-lip-allure-soft-satin-lipstick-divine-brown',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/1659406-Revolution-Lastiiss-Lipstick-Divine-Brown-1.jpg?v=1755882023","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/1659406-Revolution--Kiss-Lipstick-Divine-Brown-3.jpg?v=1755882025"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
