96% confirment que le patch protège et rend l''imperfection moins visible**.

*Étude clinique sur 64 sujets.
**Auto-évaluation, 58 sujets, après 1 application.',11700,'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/A.PACKSHOTFRONT_6c33a149-846a-49fb-b47a-bb0d2fe6d4d0.jpg?v=1761240735',10,1,'8335256223919','45999101313199','https://beautymarket.ma/products/la-roche-posay-effaclar-patch-anti-imperfections-duo-m-anti-bouton-anti-acne',1,'["https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/A.PACKSHOTFRONT_6c33a149-846a-49fb-b47a-bb0d2fe6d4d0.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/K.PACKSHOTFRONT.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/D.BEFORE_AFTER.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/E.TEXTURE.png?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/L.PACKSHOTBACK.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/B.BENEFPRODUIT1_e8d4b290-feac-4649-be24-230a2c78d6d7.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/C.BENEFPRODUIT2.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/F.ACTIFS.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/G.MODED_EMPLOI.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/H.CIBLE.jpg?v=1761240735","https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0572/7938/1679/files/I.ROUTINE.jpg?v=1761240735"]',NULL) ON CONFLICT(source_variant_id) DO NOTHING;
